  "verbalization": "The visible evidence suggests a complex but consistent relationship between 2,3-Pentanediol and SNB-78, with multiple pathways linking the former to the latter through intermediate compounds. All three paths indicate that 2,3-Pentanediol acts as a target for SNU-387, which in turn is a target of several compounds, including 5-Hydroxy-6,8-Dimethoxy-2,3-Dimethylbenzo[G]Chromen-4-One and Quercetagetin 3-methyl ether 7-glucoside. These intermediates ultimately target SNB-78, suggesting a potential mechanism involving the activation or modulation of SNB-78 by these compounds. The shared involvement of SNU-387 across different pathways implies a possible common functional role or a shared target mechanism, though the exact nature of this relationship remains to be elucidated. The evidence supports a hierarchical pathway where 2,3-Pentanediol serves as a precursor or modulator in the activation of SNB-78, though the precise molecular interactions and mechanisms remain to be fully characterized.",
